WEBVTT

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:08.580
It’s been four months since
the Iries started taking care of our family.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.240
I’ve finally gotten used to living with them.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.730
What a big mouth.

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:17.940
Hurry up, I need to use it too.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:21.000
I’m finishing up, wait!

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.500
Sheesh, he’s such a bully.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:32.760
But, he’s Irie Naoki, the guy I admire.

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:37.470
My, you two are up pretty early during summer break.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:39.760
Good morning.

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:41.250
I have club activities.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.330
It looks like her reason
is different though.

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:45.970
Kotoko-chan!

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:49.270
Let’s go to our extra classes together!

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:51.280
Kin-chan!

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:52.500
Extra classes?

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.030
Weren’t you fiftieth?

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:55.440
Yeah.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:58.320
Those were the midterms.
You did poorly on the finals, right?

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.750
You really are stupid.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.260
What are you talking about?!

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:40.720
Extra classes, right? You’re hopeless without my brother’s help like I thought.

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:42.970
His foul mouth isn’t getting any better...

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:45.010
What are you writing?

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:47.450
Don’t look! It’s my open research project.

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:49.660
Eh? You’ve started already?

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:52.730
Of course. It’s homework after all.

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:57.340
Honestly! Summer homework is supposed to be left until the last two days of vacation.

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:59.540
And that’s why you have to
attend extra classes.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.870
I’m going now.

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.470
I have to hurry too!

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:08.370
I forgot my bag!

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:11.670
Sheesh, what a noisy girl.

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:14.500
But, that makes it perfect
right from the start.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:22.380
July 26th. Summer vacation begins today.

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:26.080
However, this morning, Kotoko was already in a panic getting to her extra classes.

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:30.100
I thought, “I don’t want to become a high schooler like that.”

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:34.020
Morning, Mr. Genius.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:39.000
How classy, playing tennis
right from the morning.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.900
You seem to be putting in
a lot of effort yourself.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:47.670
Hmph! You never know when being called a genius all the time will turn you into a monster!

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:50.040
Yeah, that’s true.

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:51.880
What?!

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.620
Kin-chan, sorry to keep you. Shall we go?

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:00.180
Have fun!

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:07.590
The Papas are having a school reunion?

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:10.720
I got it!

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.780
Kotoko, morning.

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:17.940
Morning.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:21.570
Weren’t you supposed to be
the Irie of Class-F?

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:25.460
I guess the effect of the charm wore off.

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:27.000
That’s so like you.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.320
Oh, come to think of it,
your husband is here too.

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:37.540
What are you girls watching?

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:43.790
Irie-kun is really cool after all!

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:50.120
Kotoko, there’s more to a guy
than just coolness!

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:57.860
Okay, that’s all for today.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.110
Hey, Kotoko.

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:04.260
By the way, how’s the construction of your new house going?

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:08.950
I’m actually not very sure myself.

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:14.330
My dad hasn’t told me much either.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.700
Sheesh. In that case, let’s go take a look.

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:19.050
Right now?

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:20.320
Yup.

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:21.940
Let’s see how it’s going.

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:25.720
You should leave that devil’s house as soon as possible.

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.220
You’re kidding me!

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:32.260
Huh, it hasn’t progressed at all.

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:34.600
They’ve only done this much
in four months?

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.700
What’s the meaning of this?

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:39.560
Hey, Kotoko!

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:42.480
We’ll make this one Yuuki’s room.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:46.620
That’s right.
He’ll grow really big soon and all.

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:50.140
Then, I wonder if it’s all right to make this the karaoke room.

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:52.490
Put that in the basement please.

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:58.680
More importantly, we have to decide on Onii-chan and Kotoko’s new room.

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:01.500
And also their baby’s room too.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.380
You don’t have to care for us that much.

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.120
It’s okay.

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:11.560
First, we have to wait for them to graduate next year.

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:13.410
Then, we can proceed with the plan.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:15.220
Proceed with what plan?

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:16.020
Nothing.

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:19.940
Nao!

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.520
Naoki-kun!

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:25.690
I’m back!

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.030
Dad, the new house...!

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:33.120
This isn’t funny! Me marrying her?!

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:34.700
Marry?

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:36.950
Please calm down, Naoki.

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:39.760
But, you’d surely oppose if I told you.

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:43.630
Of course! There’s no way I could stay with someone like that forever!

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:46.420
What do you mean by that?!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:50.050
I’m just saying that I should have the right to choose.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:55.060
Even if you say you want to marry me later, I definitely won’t marry you!

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:57.240
That sure puts me at ease.

00:06:57.240 --> 00:07:00.060
That way, if I do fall in love with you,
I’ll be spared that mistake.

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.910
Fall in love?

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:06.760
Anyway, let’s end this discussion.

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:10.360
Why does Onii-chan have to be like that?

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.120
I’ve had it!

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:20.910
He didn’t have to talk like that!

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:28.740
It’s Jinko.

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:30.300
Hello?

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:33.260
Hmm, Waterland?

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:34.820
When are you going?

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:41.350
August 26th? The day right after our extra classes end, right?

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:44.060
Going to the pool with everyone? Sounds like fun!

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.480
Kotoko-chan is going to the pool?

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:56.920
Kotoko is still up to her stupid acts.

00:07:57.930 --> 00:08:03.080
August 5th. Mom made a cake today.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:09.130
After Kotoko started helping halfway through, it turned into something absolutely disgusting.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:12.150
I was really angry.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:19.350
August 10th. Onii-chan said that Kotoko’s snoring was incredibly loud.

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:22.900
I’d like to confirm it for myself next time.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.230
Sorry about this, Mama.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:31.820
The two of us will be gone for a week.

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:34.850
Don’t worry about it.
It’s a reunion, isn’t it?

00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:39.030
And, it’s been a while since you went back to your parents’ place. Take your time.

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.790
Kotoko, I’ll be sure to bring back a souvenir for you.

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:43.500
Have a safe trip.

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:47.170
We’re off then!

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:50.800
They sure are in high spirits.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:53.830
You’re on summer break now. You should do something fun.

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:55.010
I guess you’re right.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:57.510
For instance, how about the pool?

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:01.810
Yes. We’re planning on going to Waterland after our extra classes.

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:10.770
All right! It’s time to swim!

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:13.800
There are so many swimming pools!

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:15.560
Are there no cute guys around?

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:19.370
Places like this are only filled with people bringing their kids anyway.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.850
Oh, I guess so.

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:25.190
But even if there were, with the swimsuit Kotoko is wearing...

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:26.370
What is it?

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:28.290
Isn’t it all right for Kotoko?

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:30.750
What’s that supposed to mean?

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:34.170
That’s not true. You’re pretty no matter what you wear.

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:38.070
Is there something wrong with what I’m wearing?

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:38.300
What an unappealing swimsuit.
Is there something wrong with what I’m wearing?

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:39.930
What an unappealing swimsuit.

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:43.610
Irie-kun!

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:49.360
What is this? Are you following us?

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.690
Good work.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:54.690
We’re not like you, so of course not.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:10:00.200
I guess Irie-kun would prefer it if I was wearing a swimsuit like Satomi’s.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.700
I see now.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:04.410
The pool?

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:07.440
Mama said I could go only if you went along.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.480
Why me?

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:12.440
Hey! You’re his big brother, aren’t you?

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:14.840
So that’s the reason.

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:18.280
Is it a good idea for the extra class bunch to be here?

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.230
You haven’t finished your
homework yet, right?

00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:23.800
Didn’t I tell you?
I’ll finish it on the last two days.

00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:27.860
It’s summer break after all.
Forget about things like homework.

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:29.670
What’s the point if you don’t enjoy yourself?

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:31.510
Come on, Kotoko. Let’s go.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:41.570
How’s this, Kotoko? Are you watching?

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:44.490
Look, look, what a great front crawl.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:46.580
This one next!

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.290
Kin-chan, that’s so embarrassing.

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:52.540
Kotoko!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.920
Leave it to me! I’ll get Kotoko’s ball.

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:07.060
That’s right. I won’t be able to observe properly if I don’t go closer.

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:10.560
Onii-chan, I want some ice cream.

00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:15.070
Ice cream? Wait here then.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:29.580
Observation journal of the stupid Kotoko. Today she’s wearing her school swimsuit.

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:36.170
Onii-chan!

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:37.990
One vanilla, correct?

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:38.810
Yes.

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:40.070
Did something happen?

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:42.060
Seems like some kid nearly drowned.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:43.820
Is he okay?

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:44.430
Sir!

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:48.930
Yuuki!

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:56.160
Yuuki-kun.

00:11:57.260 --> 00:12:00.680
Yuuki-kun! Hey, Yuuki-kun!

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:03.450
Where am I?

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:05.170
Thank goodness.

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:06.430
Why are you guys...?

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:10.410
Sheesh, what a thing to say after Kotoko saved you.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:11.840
Saved?

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:22.880
You shouldn’t go into a pool where your legs don’t reach the bottom.

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:26.500
But, kid, don’t you know how to swim?

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:29.250
Shut up! Don’t touch me, you idiot!

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:30.790
Especially since you’re part of the extra class bunch.

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:32.640
What did you say?!

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:38.000
Yuuki-kun!

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:52.210
Damn it, what’s up with them? Treating me like a kid...

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:53.790
Hey, Yuuki-kun.

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:58.260
Did you come to laugh at me?

00:12:58.260 --> 00:13:00.250
No.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.800
Then, why?

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:09.410
Let’s ride that.

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:17.020
This place is famous for that water slide.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:17.850
Okay?

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:27.500
“It’s summer break! Gotta have fun, right?”

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:28.910
Is what he’d say.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:35.800
Let’s go!

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:38.840
Fine, but let go!

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:39.970
Hurry, hurry!

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:41.280
Your stupidity will infect me!

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:41.880
Sheesh.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:44.880
I said let go, stupid!

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:48.060
All right! I challenge you!

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:50.000
Like I’d lose to the likes of you!

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:52.100
I’ll show you the difference
between our skills!

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:00.060
I won’t lose!

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:03.230
There’s no way I’d lose to an idiot!

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:06.950
I’m glad Yuuki-kun seems all right.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:09.930
Kin-chan sure gets along well with that kid.

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:12.620
You mean Kin-chan is like an
elementary school kid?

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:14.880
Hey!

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:17.070
Hurry and slide down too, Kotoko!

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:19.130
Are you scared?!

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:21.460
You said it this time! All right.

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:29.390
My leg is cramped!

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:40.520
Save me, Irie-kun!

00:14:43.050 --> 00:14:44.890
Are you okay?

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:54.380
Irie-kun.

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:56.740
Thanks.

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:59.950
Not a problem.
You saved Yuuki too, didn’t you?

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:01.540
Huh? Yeah.

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:07.260
Irie-kun is so gentle.

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:15.510
What do you want?!

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.520
Kotoko...

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:34.870
Gosh, Onii-chan.
Though you say such things...

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.540
Just one more push.

00:15:37.190 --> 00:15:40.890
August 26th. I went to the pool today.

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:44.600
Kotoko nearly drowned while playing in her unappealing swimsuit.

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:47.050
So, I saved her.

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:54.300
Kotoko-chan.

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:58.770
I’m sorry, but something came up and I have to go to my parents’ place too.

00:15:59.650 --> 00:16:01.060
What happened?

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:05.020
I got a call earlier informing me that my mother isn’t feeling well.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.920
That sounds bad.

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:12.280
It looks like it isn’t serious. But, I’m worried, so I wanted to go check up on her.

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:14.530
Okay. Then...

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:19.300
I’m bringing Yuuki with me. So I’m leaving the house to you and Onii-chan.

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:21.750
Oka... What?

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:23.280
Why only me?

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:24.750
Don’t complain! Hurry up!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.050
No! I want to stay behind too!

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:28.030
No!

00:16:32.140 --> 00:16:34.970
I’ll be alone with Irie-kun!

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.890
Hey.

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:39.940
Please take care of dinner.

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:51.230
Okay! I’m gonna make something amazing and surprise Irie-kun!

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:59.740
Why did it turn out like this?

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.750
I’m sorry, Irie-kun.

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:11.800
You can cook too.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.800
I just learned how.

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:22.290
I can’t believe I’m having a meal alone with Irie-kun.

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:24.010
We’re like newlyweds.

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:25.490
Yeah, right!

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:27.270
Is it good?

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:33.190
Gotta think of something to talk about.

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:36.120
Umm, Irie-kun...

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:37.700
About the homework...

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:40.080
I finished it in one day.

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:44.840
Fair warning, but you won’t be able to finish it in two days with that head of yours.

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:47.180
Is it really that hard?

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:49.710
Well, good luck.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.590
Don’t you feel like helping me a little...?

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:52.840
Nope.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:55.340
How cold.

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:57.810
That’s cold!

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:00.730
What am I doing here?

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:04.840
I wonder if those two have created a good mood about now?

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:09.180
Perhaps, it may even be going faster than planned.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:14.390
I’m in serious trouble!

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:17.860
Maybe this isn’t the best time to be worrying about being alone with Irie-kun.

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:25.330
Irie-kun is probably fast asleep by now.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:28.000
Since he’s already finished his homework.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.540
That’s right! He has finished!

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.800
Dear God, dear Buddha, please forgive me.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:39.260
I’d like to see the answers just for a little bit.

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:44.260
Infiltrating like the wind,
the female ninja Kotoko appears!

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:52.270
What is she doing?

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:03.420
August 28th. Summer break will be over in three days.

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:06.720
But, Kotoko hasn’t even started
her homework yet.

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:08.850
She’ll probably be bawling like a baby.

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:11.120
I’m looking forward to it.

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:13.660
What the hell is this?!

00:19:17.570 --> 00:19:19.640
Honestly, what a rude kid!

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:21.920
I may have written a lot of things,

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:25.430
but she’s actually a very pretty, kind-hearted and wonderful Onee-san.

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:27.220
I love her!

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:30.580
That’s fixed.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:33.610
That’s not it!

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:36.170
This isn’t the time to be doing things like that!

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:41.180
Where’s Irie-kun’s textbook?

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:44.870
Here it is!

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:47.870
This is it!

00:19:52.130 --> 00:19:53.460
What are you doing?

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:58.080
I’m not doing anything!

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:00.900
I haven’t stolen anything!

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:02.650
I know.

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:10.730
Don’t worry.
I won’t make it embarrassing for you.

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:16.110
He said it before, you never know when a genius might turn into a monster.

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:19.740
No! I like you, Irie-kun, but...

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:24.700
...it’s still too early! We should have a wholesome relationship first...

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:29.870
Don’t worry.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:32.830
Never mind the wholesome part, I don’t intend to date you at all.

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.540
You were teasing me!

00:20:38.140 --> 00:20:40.020
Hey, you forgot something.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:43.780
That’s too bad.

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:48.980
I was thinking of lending you my textbook to apologize for scaring you.

00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:52.060
Too bad then if you don’t want it.

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:56.810
I’ll borrow it then since you insist.

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:01.280
Also, I need your help to copy.

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:03.830
Why this little...

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:07.330
Oh, I see.

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:08.500
I think I get it.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.040
She’s really something else.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:12.080
Irie-kun, what’s this?

00:21:14.240 --> 00:21:17.380
Wait. Didn’t you say you understood that a moment ago?

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:22.260
Well, I sort of understood it
when you told me.

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:24.720
Unimaginable.

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:25.580
Like this?

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:26.710
Wrong!

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:28.380
Really? Why?

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:32.720
What am I getting so worked up for?

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:34.380
Ouch!

00:23:07.620 --> 00:23:09.830
It’s all over!

00:23:09.830 --> 00:23:10.730
Jinko?

00:23:10.730 --> 00:23:14.120
My hopes for getting into a university are gone! It’s hopeless!

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:15.160
Calm down!

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:19.080
That’s it, Kotoko! Please ask Irie to tutor us!

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:20.920
That’s definitely impossible!

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:23.290
Pretty please!

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:25.690
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:25.690 --> 00:23:27.920
The crucial moment! Class-F’s winter battle!

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:29.760
I’m definitely gonna be happy.

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:34.030
We want to be university students!
